    "mainText": "About me\n\nI’m Alan, a UI/UX Designer at an IT consulting company, based in Indonesia.\n\nWhere I’m heading\n\nMy primary focus is Product Designer opportunities. I’m also learning toward Design Engineer roles and open to opportunities in that direction.\n\nFrom a problem to a prototype\n\nMy background includes user research, wireframing, and prototyping for web and mobile interfaces. I’m interested in how those design decisions carry through to a working product.\n\nBringing design and development closer\n\nI’m learning to connect design decisions with what can be built: understand technical constraints, explain design intent, and build and refine interfaces.\n\nResume\n\nAn updated resume will be available here once verified."
